      "comment": "MOET MAGIC (2) boasts a consistent overall record including 15 wins from 69 starts, but missed the frame latest when fifth (35.19) over 600m at Q Parklands. Has a good record here at this journey. Well placed here and can go close with a clear run. HARA'S WALSH (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (30.80) in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. FADE TO BLACK (8) goes very well this trip starting 16 times for nine wins and three minors. Comes off a (29.76) win last time, scoring by 5.5 lengths in a Mix 5 over 520m at Q Parklands. Looks well placed here and among the chances. ",
